1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:25,180 --> 00:02:26,400
Red Butterfly !

25
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:28,280
You indeed know me.

26
00:02:28,900 --> 00:02:29,610
Speak,

27
00:02:30,300 --> 00:02:31,400
who the hell are you ?

28
00:02:31,820 --> 00:02:34,460
Who doesn't know Xue Yue's genius ?

29
00:02:35,060 --> 00:02:36,380
Not going to tell me ?

30
00:02:36,420 --> 00:02:37,180
Then you will

31
00:02:37,980 --> 00:02:38,980
remain here forever !

32
00:02:51,290 --> 00:02:52,480
This is her domain !

33
00:03:00,140 --> 00:03:01,200
Master, what's going on ?

34
00:03:01,220 --> 00:03:02,160
Wake up !

35
00:03:04,740 --> 00:03:06,300
Early stage Soul Formation...

36
00:03:06,940 --> 00:03:08,480
If you don't struggle,

37
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:10,220
you can have a painless death.

38
00:03:16,260 --> 00:03:17,840
My memories and emotions

39
00:03:18,580 --> 00:03:19,780
are becoming numb...

40
00:03:33,380 --> 00:03:34,100
Wan'er...

41
00:03:39,140 --> 00:03:40,300
I hate you !!!

42
00:03:41,540 --> 00:03:43,460
I never believed in fate !

43
00:03:44,370 --> 00:03:45,230
She's already gone.

44
00:03:45,250 --> 00:03:46,510
I told you not to tell her.

45
00:03:46,510 --> 00:03:47,330
It's all your fault !

46
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:49,130
You... You...

47
00:03:50,340 --> 00:03:51,060
Enough !

48
00:03:53,340 --> 00:03:55,460
If I were to get lost in this emotionless domain,

49
00:03:56,540 --> 00:03:57,620
I'll never be the same again.

50
00:03:58,460 --> 00:04:00,540
I would become an emotionless murderer.

51
00:04:01,780 --> 00:04:03,740
Life and death are controlled by her thoughts.

52
00:04:04,460 --> 00:04:05,440
Her domain

53
00:04:05,500 --> 00:04:07,240
is capable of freezing emotions.

54
00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:09,420
The domain of this genius

55
00:04:09,620 --> 00:04:10,860
is so domineering.

56
00:04:11,220 --> 00:04:12,740
If I can't break her domain,

57
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:14,500
I'll be in deep trouble.

58
00:04:15,180 --> 00:04:16,840
This snow is born in the sky

59
00:04:16,900 --> 00:04:18,500
and dies on the earth.

60
00:04:19,500 --> 00:04:22,420
I heard Red Butterfly managed to reach Peak Late stage Soul Formation

61
00:04:22,900 --> 00:04:24,220
in a mere 100 years.

62
00:04:24,820 --> 00:04:26,860
100 years is the lifetime of a mortal.

63
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:28,740
I wonder if your parents

64
00:04:29,220 --> 00:04:30,300
are still alive.

65
00:04:40,180 --> 00:04:41,140
Red Butterfly,

66
00:04:41,260 --> 00:04:42,620
do your parents have

67
00:04:43,100 --> 00:04:44,300
any other children ?

68
00:04:44,820 --> 00:04:48,220
If not, doesn’t that mean they have no one to send them off ?

69
00:04:48,260 --> 00:04:50,780
That means you are... unfilial.

70
00:04:51,740 --> 00:04:52,740
Know your place !

71
00:04:58,140 --> 00:04:59,220
Your domain

72
00:04:59,820 --> 00:05:00,620
is too weak.

73
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,240
Instead of collapsing,

74
00:05:17,300 --> 00:05:18,620
his domain is spreading out.

75
00:05:18,780 --> 00:05:20,220
As long as I can kill him...

76
00:05:21,220 --> 00:05:22,380
For 100 years,

77
00:05:23,140 --> 00:05:24,220
mortals have lived.

78
00:05:25,140 --> 00:05:26,100
Was your family

79
00:05:26,340 --> 00:05:28,340
wiped out by the law of the heavens ?

80
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:30,380
Red Butterfly,

81
00:05:31,100 --> 00:05:32,780
even if your parents are dead,

82
00:05:33,860 --> 00:05:36,100
they will always be looking at you.

83
00:05:36,740 --> 00:05:38,660
Do you dare to look back at them !?

84
00:05:45,060 --> 00:05:46,580
The Icy Snow Tactic

85
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:48,700
requires a clear heart.

86
00:05:49,850 --> 00:05:51,500
That's why I was suspicious.

87
00:05:52,220 --> 00:05:54,480
Red Butterfly has only cultivated for 100 years.

88
00:05:54,820 --> 00:05:56,520
No matter her talent,

89
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,300
she couldn't have wiped all her emotions.

90
00:05:59,460 --> 00:06:00,500
Love never dies.

91
00:06:02,100 --> 00:06:04,030
Naturally, her Dao Heart is unstable.

92
00:06:04,340 --> 00:06:05,860
Dragon Restriction, attack !

93
00:06:11,420 --> 00:06:12,900
A mere Early stage Soul Formation

94
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:15,340
tried to ruin my Dao Heart.

95
00:06:15,940 --> 00:06:17,380
I can't allow him to live !

96
00:06:30,300 --> 00:06:31,120
Master,

97
00:06:31,210 --> 00:06:32,820
that woman has a higher cultivation than you.

98
00:06:32,860 --> 00:06:34,780
Why are you so chill about it ?

99
00:06:34,900 --> 00:06:35,260
She...

100
00:06:36,020 --> 00:06:37,820
She is going to catch up with us !

101
00:06:38,220 --> 00:06:39,580
You can't escape.

102
00:06:44,700 --> 00:06:46,580
Master, what are you doing ?!

103
00:06:46,700 --> 00:06:47,940
Run away !

104
00:06:48,700 --> 00:06:49,940
I won't run away.

105
00:06:58,020 --> 00:06:58,820
This is...

106
00:08:00,100 --> 00:08:00,600
You !

107
00:08:01,620 --> 00:08:03,420
He has access to teleportation formations

108
00:08:03,820 --> 00:08:05,920
so his identity must not be exceptional.

109
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:08,360
His Dao Heart is strong,

110
00:08:08,540 --> 00:08:09,800
he's very cautious,

111
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,120
has a strange domain,

112
00:08:11,380 --> 00:08:12,740
and extraordinary artifacts.

113
00:08:13,940 --> 00:08:16,180
He must be the most elite disciple

114
00:08:16,620 --> 00:08:18,580
of a rank 5 country of Suzaku.

115
00:08:19,930 --> 00:08:22,380
Rain Celestial Realm\NLava fragment

116
00:08:25,500 --> 00:08:27,020
That palm strike was empty

117
00:08:27,580 --> 00:08:29,110
but it managed to fool Red Butterfly.

118
00:08:29,260 --> 00:08:31,310
Otherwise, with our gap in cultivation,

119
00:08:31,460 --> 00:08:32,940
it would have been hard to escape.

120
00:08:33,170 --> 00:08:35,300
I almost ran out of spiritual energy...

121
00:08:35,420 --> 00:08:37,340
This palm strike was really expensive.

122
00:08:49,020 --> 00:08:50,180
Spatial rifts ?

123
00:09:01,900 --> 00:09:03,000
There are spatial rifts ahead

124
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:03,920
and lava below,

125
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:06,180
even if there is a treasure here, it must be ruined.

126
00:09:07,620 --> 00:09:10,260
Why did the Da Lou Sword Sect build the teleportation formation here ?

127
00:09:10,540 --> 00:09:12,420
There must be something inside this cave.

128
00:09:13,460 --> 00:09:14,780
This place is very strange.

129
00:09:15,660 --> 00:09:17,820
But it's too dangerous to enter alone.

130
00:09:18,940 --> 00:09:20,500
I need to wait for other people,

131
00:09:21,420 --> 00:09:22,740
that's my best chance.

132
00:09:28,580 --> 00:09:31,300
3 days later

133
00:09:36,740 --> 00:09:38,100
So they have come.

134
00:09:41,300 --> 00:09:42,480
Third Senior Brother,

135
00:09:42,860 --> 00:09:44,860
is this the Celestial Beast Temple ?

136
00:09:45,460 --> 00:09:46,340
Correct.

137
00:09:46,820 --> 00:09:50,060
Zheng Hao\NDa Lou Sword Sect disciple\NEarly stage Soul Formation

138
00:09:46,900 --> 00:09:47,660
This place

139
00:09:47,860 --> 00:09:50,380
is one of the 16 Celestial Beast Temples.

140
00:09:51,500 --> 00:09:53,260
The Ancestor found this place by accident.

141
00:09:53,700 --> 00:09:54,930
After thousands of years,

142
00:09:55,060 --> 00:09:56,680
