143
00:09:57,820 --> 00:09:59,810
Sixth Junior Brother, you just reached Soul Formation

144
00:09:59,930 --> 00:10:01,910
You must pay attention to the spacial rifts.

145
00:10:02,020 --> 00:10:04,040
Remember to always have the Full Search Tactic activated.

146
00:10:05,620 --> 00:10:08,080
Da Lou Sword Sect\NFull Search Tactic

147
00:10:11,820 --> 00:10:12,740
This Full Search Tactic

148
00:10:13,300 --> 00:10:15,900
must be able to help them avoid the spacial rifts.

149
00:10:16,660 --> 00:10:18,560
It's very useful in the Celestial Realm.

150
00:10:26,060 --> 00:10:29,300
Celestial Beast Temple\NLava fragment\NRain Celestial Realm

151
00:10:26,260 --> 00:10:28,860
Remember you can't use teleportation inside.

152
00:10:30,100 --> 00:10:31,420
You must be careful.

153
00:10:36,580 --> 00:10:37,380
Third Senior Brother,

154
00:10:38,140 --> 00:10:40,560
this Celestial Beast Temple has been here for so many years

155
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:42,720
so it should already have been emptied.

156
00:10:43,700 --> 00:10:45,820
Even if there are Celestial Beast Souls remaining,

157
00:10:46,060 --> 00:10:48,980
I'm afraid they would be hard to obtain for just the two of us.

158
00:10:49,900 --> 00:10:52,020
The Celestial Realm lacks spiritual energy.

159
00:10:52,620 --> 00:10:53,940
If there are any

160
00:10:54,380 --> 00:10:55,340
Celestial Beast Souls left,

161
00:10:55,700 --> 00:10:56,820
they must be very weak.

162
00:10:57,260 --> 00:10:58,500
If we bring back one,

163
00:10:58,740 --> 00:11:00,220
we will be rewarded.

164
00:11:01,060 --> 00:11:03,140
Back then, the Ancestor was able to find

165
00:11:03,460 --> 00:11:05,060
a Celestial Beast Soul here.

166
00:11:05,980 --> 00:11:07,900
He then proceeded to unite planet Da Lou.

167
00:11:13,180 --> 00:11:14,380
There's such a treasure ?

168
00:11:15,140 --> 00:11:16,760
No wonder they placed the formation here.

169
00:11:23,540 --> 00:11:25,160
Celestial Beast Temple

170
00:11:42,980 --> 00:11:44,620
Here's some celestial spiritual energy.

171
00:11:44,900 --> 00:11:45,980
Back then, the Ancestor

172
00:11:46,020 --> 00:11:47,860
found a Celestial Beast Soul here.

173
00:11:48,660 --> 00:11:49,290
Junior,

174
00:11:49,740 --> 00:11:50,500
protect me

175
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,940
while I gather this celestial spiritual energy.

176
00:11:53,380 --> 00:11:53,980
Okay.

177
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:10,180
Da Lou Sword Sect\NSoul Purification Gourd

178
00:12:21,580 --> 00:12:24,380
This gourd can gather celestial spiritual energy much quicker.

179
00:12:28,540 --> 00:12:30,360
Celestial jades

180
00:12:33,340 --> 00:12:34,440
Sixth Junior Brother,

181
00:12:34,820 --> 00:12:36,420
we've got a good harvest this time.

182
00:12:36,820 --> 00:12:37,900
The celestial spiritual energy

183
00:12:38,380 --> 00:12:39,820
was enough for 2 celestial jades.

184
00:12:40,900 --> 00:12:41,900
Keep this one.

185
00:12:42,620 --> 00:12:43,340
This way,

186
00:12:43,940 --> 00:12:46,920
we've both completed the lowest requirement of our sect.

187
00:12:48,220 --> 00:12:48,860
Thank you.

188
00:12:50,940 --> 00:12:51,780
Third Senior Brother,

189
00:12:51,820 --> 00:12:53,420
Is this the Soul Purification Gourd ?

190
00:12:54,900 --> 00:12:55,620
Correct.

191
00:12:56,460 --> 00:12:58,380
This is one of the 3 Soul Purification Gourds

192
00:12:59,100 --> 00:13:01,700
personally refined by the Ancestor.

193
00:13:02,780 --> 00:13:03,700
With this,

194
00:13:04,460 --> 00:13:06,280
we can quickly gather celestial spiritual energy

195
00:13:06,280 --> 00:13:08,260
without wasting time refining it.

196
00:13:08,740 --> 00:13:09,820
What was that sound ?

197
00:13:14,900 --> 00:13:18,140
Celestial Beast Temple\NLava fragment\NRain Celestial Realm

198
00:13:29,820 --> 00:13:30,180
Junior,

199
00:13:30,700 --> 00:13:31,300
go ahead

200
00:13:32,020 --> 00:13:34,020
to see what that ball of light is.

201
00:13:34,620 --> 00:13:35,080
I...

202
00:13:37,380 --> 00:13:39,540
Why does this look familiar ?

203
00:13:40,260 --> 00:13:41,280
Don't be afraid Junior,

204
00:13:41,660 --> 00:13:43,400
your Senior is protecting you.

205
00:13:43,460 --> 00:13:44,260
Go for it.

206
00:13:56,540 --> 00:13:57,820
Get closer !

207
00:14:13,020 --> 00:14:14,020
3 more steps !

208
00:14:16,940 --> 00:14:17,860
Bring the skull here !

209
00:14:34,740 --> 00:14:35,260
Chase !

210
00:14:37,460 --> 00:14:38,020
Senior Brother,

211
00:14:38,500 --> 00:14:39,500
what the hell was that ?

212
00:14:40,660 --> 00:14:41,940
If I'm not mistaken,

213
00:14:42,020 --> 00:14:43,620
this is a Celestial Beast Feed.

214
00:14:46,380 --> 00:14:48,060
It turns out that was a Celestial Beast Feed.

215
00:14:49,260 --> 00:14:51,240
No wonder the mosquito beast loved it.

216
00:14:52,260 --> 00:14:54,460
But compared to those of the Sea of Devils,

217
00:14:55,380 --> 00:14:56,660
this Celestial Beast Feed

218
00:14:57,260 --> 00:14:58,900
is way more powerful.

219
00:15:02,690 --> 00:15:05,140
Mere feed for celestial beasts and it has this much power ?

220
00:15:06,700 --> 00:15:08,380
If that thing had entered my brow,

221
00:15:10,060 --> 00:15:11,820
I would have turned into a skeleton…

222
00:15:12,900 --> 00:15:15,500
You cannot be scared of mere Celestial Beast Feed.

223
00:15:16,460 --> 00:15:18,920
How are you going to be respected in the Da Lou Sword Sect ?

224
00:15:19,220 --> 00:15:21,290
If we can catch that Celestial Beast Feed,

225
00:15:21,580 --> 00:15:23,400
we will rise through the ranks.

226
00:15:31,740 --> 00:15:33,300
Using his Junior's life as a test.

227
00:15:34,820 --> 00:15:35,940
This Senior Brother

228
00:15:36,660 --> 00:15:38,260
is ill-intentioned.

229
00:15:46,060 --> 00:15:47,540
A celestial artifact ?

230
00:15:49,380 --> 00:15:50,900
I found a celestial artifact !

231
00:16:09,300 --> 00:16:10,190
Retreat !

232
00:16:20,900 --> 00:16:21,500
Die !

233
00:16:22,260 --> 00:16:23,540
Two Swords Spirit World !

234
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:34,820
Senior Brother,

235
00:16:35,460 --> 00:16:37,060
why are there so many Celestial Beast Feeds ?

236
00:16:38,780 --> 00:16:40,960
The aura of that artifact must be too strong.

237
00:16:41,100 --> 00:16:42,060
Under its influence,

238
00:16:42,420 --> 00:16:44,190
the Celestial Beast Feeds grew to such an extent.

239
00:16:44,220 --> 00:16:44,940
It's a disaster !

240
00:16:46,020 --> 00:16:47,060
With our cultivation,

241
00:16:47,260 --> 00:16:50,120
it will be difficult to escape so many Celestial Beast Feeds.

242
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:52,420
I can only use my Junior's life

243
00:16:52,460 --> 00:16:53,780
to keep me alive.

244
00:16:54,140 --> 00:16:54,700
Junior !

245
00:16:55,180 --> 00:16:56,670
Watch out behind you !

246
00:17:02,060 --> 00:17:02,740
Senior Brother,

247
00:17:03,540 --> 00:17:04,540
what are you doing ?

248
00:17:04,950 --> 00:17:07,300
Sun Lei\NDa Lou Sword Sect disciple\NMiddle stage Soul Formation

249
00:17:06,940 --> 00:17:08,180
Middle stage Soul Formation ?!

250
00:17:14,460 --> 00:17:15,020
You...

251
00:17:15,580 --> 00:17:16,640
Who the hell are you ?

252
00:17:25,700 --> 00:17:28,210
Obtaining a celestial artifact is an unprecedented opportunity.

253
00:17:28,340 --> 00:17:30,620
While the Celestial Beast Feeds are running rampant,

254
00:17:30,900 --> 00:17:33,140
now is my best chance to get it.

255
00:17:52,070 --> 00:17:58,750
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust\Nlike water without a source.

256
00:17:58,820 --> 00:18:04,910
Like the difference between clouds and mud,\Nthe truth cannot be found in conflict.

257
00:18:05,020 --> 00:18:08,850
Life and death\Nare like the moment when the rain falls

258
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:12,780
and like many other unseparable things.

259
00:18:13,140 --> 00:18:18,790
In this lifetime,\Nto cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

260
00:18:19,970 --> 00:18:25,800
Old grudges had to be settled\Nbecause half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

261
00:18:26,110 --> 00:18:31,650
Use the most vivid love and hate\Nto ask questions to your fate.

262
00:18:32,110 --> 00:18:36,330
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage\Nto pierce the heart and the soul

263
00:18:36,590 --> 00:18:39,820
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

264
00:18:39,990 --> 00:18:45,810
Only when you bend down can you understand\Nthe hidden edge of the blade.

265
00:18:46,330 --> 00:18:50,010
The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.

266
00:18:50,110 --> 00:18:53,930
Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.

267
00:18:54,110 --> 00:18:59,780
Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.

268
00:19:00,040 --> 00:19:03,710
One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

269
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:07,490
One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

270
00:19:07,610 --> 00:19:13,530
Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.

271
00:19:13,600 --> 00:19:17,610
The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.

272
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:21,430
Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.

273
00:19:22,020 --> 00:19:27,260
Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.

274
00:19:27,330 --> 00:19:31,210
One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

275
00:19:31,250 --> 00:19:35,050
One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

276
00:19:35,350 --> 00:19:40,910
Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.

277
00:19:41,550 --> 00:19:47,770
Snow falls as my hair turns white, winter withers\Nwhile prosperity sprouts in summer.

278
00:19:48,070 --> 00:19:54,570
I step into the world, with light at my fingertips,\Nthe law of cause and effect.

279
00:19:55,590 --> 00:20:01,290
I observe the vastness of heaven and earth so I can get rid of evil.

280
00:20:01,460 --> 00:20:08,160
Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.\NReincarnation is not to be feared.
